    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      580.46,
      297.78,
      675.53
    ],
    "text": "Allotment of land called ''Haputalegama (part) (F.V.P.461)'' depicted as Lot No. A in Advance TracingB/HPT/2017/301 of .12.30.2017 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in Haputalegama (63) Grama Niladhari Division of Mahapalatha Korale Minor Division in Haputale Divisional Secretary's Division in Badulla District and boundries are follows.",
